# Build context rules for `docker build -f pipeline/Dockerfile .` (context: the repository root).
# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile; a pipeline/.dockerignore
# would not be read for a root context. Spec 04 design "Hosting" names the include list.
#
# Everything is excluded, then the include list is let back in. The Service image holds no raw
# archival download, no work file, no proposal, no tile image and no test: it can hold no
# precomputed result for any plate, the held-out plate included (spec 04 requirements 17.1 to 17.3).
**

!pipeline/pyproject.toml
!pipeline/uv.lock
!pipeline/buried_pipeline/**

!data/project.json
!data/sources.json
!data/schema/evidence.schema.json
!data/schema/studio_api.schema.json
!data/evidence/*.geojson
!data/present/*.geojson
!data/control/*.json
!data/control/map_area/*.json
!data/alignment/*.json
!data/tiles/*.json

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
